OL,3,GNEWSA'Beery Bikers' pedal all the way
OL,4,Ato Spain for charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo pals - dubbed the Beery Bikers -
OL,7,Fhave completed a charity cycle ride
OL,8,Ffrom Northamptonshire to Spain in
OL,9,Fmemory of their loved ones.
OL,11,FJulian Annison and Michael Martin
OL,12,Fpedalled from their hometown in West
OL,13,FHaddon, posting their ride on social
OL,14,Fmedia as they travelled 1,289 miles
OL,15,F(2,074 km).
OL,17,FThe friends have raised more than
OL,18,F#7,000 for the British Heart
OL,19,FFoundation, Cancer Research UK and
OL,20,FMacmillan Cancer Support in memory of
OL,21,FMartin's mum and Annison's wife, who
OL,22,Fboth passed away last year.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
